WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.031 --> 00:00:07.914
Roxy watched with horror as demons filled Metro City Park.

2
00:00:07.915 --> 00:00:14.068
Armed with spears, swords, and axes, they cackled with delight.

3
00:00:14.069 --> 00:00:18.946
"They must have traveled through the portal," Wukong said.

4
00:00:18.947 --> 00:00:23.573
The Demon of Black Rain joined the other demons, and then looked around and smiled.

5
00:00:23.574 --> 00:00:29.946
"This looks like a great kingdom—now it's mine!"

6
00:00:29.947 --> 00:00:35.177
"No, it's not," Wukong said as he twirled his iron bar.

7
00:00:35.178 --> 00:00:40.149
"You're not welcome here," Roxy added, narrowing her eyes.

8
00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:44.051
Bajie waved his rake while Wujing held up his spear.

9
00:00:44.052 --> 00:00:49.160
Jack's eyes went wide. "Cool. They look like warriors!"

10
00:00:49.161 --> 00:00:55.994
The Tang Monk grabbed him. "We need to hide!"

11
00:00:55.995 --> 00:01:01.082
The monk, Mara, Jack, and Terrell hid behind shrubs.

12
00:01:01.083 --> 00:01:05.105
The demons approached, stomping all over the picnic food.

13
00:01:05.106 --> 00:01:09.814
"Attack!" Wukong cried, charging toward the Demon of Black Rain.

14
00:01:09.815 --> 00:01:15.836
Roxy followed him while Bajie and Wujing fought smaller demons.

15
00:01:15.837 --> 00:01:21.036
"How dare you try to take over this city!" Bajie struck a demon with his rake.

16
00:01:21.037 --> 00:01:24.473
Poof! The demon turned to smoke.

17
00:01:24.474 --> 00:01:28.561
Poof! Wujing chuckled as he destroyed another demon.

18
00:01:28.562 --> 00:01:31.862
Wukong and Roxy flew toward the Demon of Black Rain.

19
00:01:31.863 --> 00:01:34.554
But a gust of wind blew them back.

20
00:01:34.555 --> 00:01:38.289
They crashed into a fence as rain poured down on them.

21
00:01:38.290 --> 00:01:42.217
"Ugh!" Wukong said, getting back on his feet.

22
00:01:42.218 --> 00:01:47.017
"I forgot about the demon's terrible wind and rain magic."

23
00:01:47.018 --> 00:01:52.987
Roxy nodded. "But don't worry—I can use my freeze breath to freeze the rain."

24
00:01:52.988 --> 00:01:59.059
"Whoa!" Wukong said. "I wish I had freeze breath!"

25
00:01:59.060 --> 00:02:02.466
They charged toward the demon again.

26
00:02:02.467 --> 00:02:07.100
As wind and rain swirled, Roxy blew. Whoo-oo-oosh!

27
00:02:07.101 --> 00:02:09.261
The demon held up a small jar.

28
00:02:09.262 --> 00:02:13.549
Roxy's freeze breath went into the jar and disappeared.

29
00:02:13.550 --> 00:02:16.289
"Huh?" Roxy scratched her head.

30
00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:21.817
Wind and rain whipped toward her and Wukong, and again they were thrown backward.

31
00:02:21.818 --> 00:02:29.877
"Grr!" Once more Roxy flew toward the demon and blew. Whoo-oo-oosh!

32
00:02:29.878 --> 00:02:33.378
The jar caught the freeze breath again.

33
00:02:33.379 --> 00:02:38.130
Roxy tumbled in the wind, crashing through the fence and landing behind a bush.

34
00:02:38.131 --> 00:02:44.154
The demon laughed.

35
00:02:44.155 --> 00:02:50.516
"I am getting so angry!" Roxy cried, stamping her foot.

36
00:02:50.517 --> 00:02:56.600
Wukong tapped her on the shoulder. "Rocket Girl, I have a plan," he whispered in her ear.

37
00:02:56.601 --> 00:03:02.977
Roxy chuckled as Wukong explained. "I love it," she said.

38
00:03:02.978 --> 00:03:06.273
Wukong and Roxy jumped out from behind the bush.

39
00:03:06.274 --> 00:03:10.413
They rushed toward the demon as he conjured more wind and rain.

40
00:03:10.414 --> 00:03:19.479
"You two should just give up!" the demon said, laughing. "I'm too powerful!"

41
00:03:19.480 --> 00:03:21.399
Roxy took a deep breath.

42
00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:26.164
Wukong took a deep breath.

43
00:03:26.165 --> 00:03:28.982
They both blew.

44
00:03:28.983 --> 00:03:34.375
The demon held up the jar toward Roxy—and Wukong's breath blasted the demon.

45
00:03:34.376 --> 00:03:38.067
The swirling rain instantly froze around him.

46
00:03:38.068 --> 00:03:43.182
The demon struggled to break free. "What happened?"

47
00:03:43.183 --> 00:03:48.804
Light sparkled. Roxy turned into Wukong, and Wukong turned into Roxy.

48
00:03:48.805 --> 00:03:53.839
Roxy laughed. "Wukong made us look like each other!"

49
00:03:53.840 --> 00:03:58.831
Wukong grinned. "And now you're stuck!"

50
00:03:58.832 --> 00:04:04.281
Pow! Roxy knocked over the demon and held down his icy cage.

51
00:04:04.282 --> 00:04:07.263
Wukong raised his iron bar, ready to strike.

52
00:04:07.264 --> 00:04:11.102
"I'll destroy you, once and for all!"

53
00:04:11.103 --> 00:04:15.114
"Help!" Mara suddenly cried.

54
00:04:15.115 --> 00:04:17.755
Both Roxy and Wukong looked over.

55
00:04:17.756 --> 00:04:24.847
Nasty-looking demons surrounded Roxy's friends and the Tang Monk!

